OL,3,GNEWSAThousands sign plea for more
OL,4,Aveteran support
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaurie, who joined the Naval Reserves
OL,7,Fin 1984, said she wanted officials to
OL,8,Ffully exempt the Armed Forces
OL,9,FCompensation Scheme and War Pension
OL,10,Fpayments from tax and benefit
OL,11,Fmeans-testing. The government has been
OL,12,Fasked to comment.
